  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A body is performing simple harmonic with an amplitude of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The velocity of the body was tripled by air Jet when it is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> from its mean position. The new amplitude of vibration is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "700",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/872a3447-aafc-452a-bfa7-06f16ee24315-image.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 75px;\" /></p><p>In SHM, velocity of the particle at any displacement,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math>.</p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><msqrt><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt></mfenced><msqrt><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>75</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>700</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
